Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.46,Hook,,0,0,0,,LE DI UN BESITO AL\NAVIÓN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ah, ahí lo veo, lo veo,\Nlo veo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:03.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}lo veo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Me toca estar con él?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué pasa si me doy un\Nbesito con él?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Qué mierda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Qué irreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:17.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Bro, lo toqué por un\Npíxel y explotó todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:17.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:20.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Qué mamada, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:22.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Qué mamada, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:24.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Cállate, Albert Einstein!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Qué vergas, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«Es física», dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, man, vete a hacer\Nfórmulas a otra parte,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:30.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«¿Qué fue eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Es física!»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:36.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, es física, es\Ntermodinámica básica.
